      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- Availability > Consistency (eventual consistency)\n- Highly scalable writes\n- Fast queries for advertisers viewing metrics <500ms\n- Fault Tolerance (dont lose click events)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Availability > Consistency (eventual consistency)\n- Highly scalable writes\n- Fast queries for advertisers viewing metrics <500ms\n- Fault Tolerance (dont lose click events)",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
